## Interface: 16001
## Title: LFG Forever
## Notes: A filterable Looking For Group browser (tank / healer / dps, level, text) with Invite and Request to Join buttons. Open with /lfg, the minimap button, or the Titan Panel button. The game's own Looking For Group window is left untouched.
